                            ICSE has a more detailed syllabus, making it
                            conceptually rich. However, it is not necessarily
                            tougher—it focuses on understanding rather than
                            memorization.
                          </p>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                          <p>
                            <b
                              >2. Do ICSE schools in Bangalore offer good
                              extracurricular activities?
                            </b>
                          </p>
