                            Yes, ICSE schools in Bangalore provide ample
                            opportunities for sports, arts, and leadership
                            activities, ensuring all-round development.
                          </p>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                          <p>
                            <b
                              >3. How does ICSE help in preparing for
                              competitive exams?
                            </b>
                          </p>
